ou. It's closing in on you, and all you can do is accelerate, dodge, and persevere...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is one: fly over 100 kilometers and claim that untouchable medal of honor. This is not only a test of skill, but also a test of will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple rules, pure challenge: every move determines how far you can fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >—Are you ready for this marathon in the sky?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/21c76b17e64f1e4f3fdde1dcd3eeac16.avif?t=1762011406\" width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⌨️</strong> Keyboard Controls: ↑ ↓ ← → <strong>/</strong> <strong>WSAD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost: <strong>Spacebar</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause: <strong>ESC key</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎮</strong> Gamepad Controls: Left Stick</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost: B</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause: Y</p>", "short_description": "This is an easy-to-learn yet incredibly challenging endless flight game. Control your little plane through the ever-changing sky, nimbly avoiding obstacles and desperately trying to escape the ever-approaching tornado behind you. Every advance is a test of skill and perseverance.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Turkish, Japanese, Polish, Thai, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/1bd409e99923e7dbc47921592bb77fd345907eb4/header.jpg?t=1762011406", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam